</div>
</div>
<br class="ltx_break ltx_break">
<div id="alg1.5" class="ltx_listing ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1a" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               <span id="alg1.l1a.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">// Initialization</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2a" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               1. Initialize feedback mechanisms for intent score <math id="alg1.l2a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{f}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐟</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{f}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> and fluency score <math id="alg1.l2a.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{f}_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐟</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{f}_{n}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               2. Generate an initial trigger <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐭</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{t}</annotation></semantics></math> using <math id="alg1.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="LLM" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">LLM</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               3. Refine trigger <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐭</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{t}</annotation></semantics></math> iteratively using feedback until predefined thresholds <math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="alg1.l4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{2}</annotation></semantics></math> are met

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               4. Embed trigger <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐭</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{t}</annotation></semantics></math> into base prompt <math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p}_{{base}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐩</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p}_{{base}}</annotation></semantics></math> to derive initial adversarial prompt <math id="alg1.l5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p}_{adv}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐩</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p}_{adv}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">// Generate adversarial Documents</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               5. Generate a synthesized document <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{base}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{base}</annotation></semantics></math> for targeted product <math id="alg1.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t_{p}</annotation></semantics></math> using <math id="alg1.l7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="LLM" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">LLM</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               6. Embed trigger <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐭</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{t}</annotation></semantics></math> into <math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{base}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{base}</annotation></semantics></math> to create a initial adversarial document <math id="alg1.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{d}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐝</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{d}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               7. Repeat Step 6 for <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> iterations to create and inject all <math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{d}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐝</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{d}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math> into the knowledge base to form <math id="alg1.l9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               <span id="alg1.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">// Diverse Query Generation</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               8. Initialize query set <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{Q}\leftarrow\{q^{(0)}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{Q}\leftarrow\{q^{(0)}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               9. Repeat until <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{Q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{Q}</annotation></semantics></math> reaches the desired size:

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
                 a. Apply a random transformation (e.g., expansion, restructuring) to <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q^{(0)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>q</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q^{(0)}</annotation></semantics></math> using <math id="alg1.l13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="LLM" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">LLM</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
                 b. Add the new query to <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{Q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{Q}</annotation></semantics></math> if its similarity to all existing queries is below the threshold

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               10. Perform steps 8-9 with targeted base query and untargeted base query to derive diverse targeted queries <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{Q}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{Q}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and diverse untargeted queries <math id="alg1.l15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{Q}_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{Q}_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               <span id="alg1.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">// Adversarial Joint Optimization</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               11. Start optimizing <math id="alg1.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="alg1.l17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p}_{adv}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐩</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p}_{adv}</annotation></semantics></math> using a genetic algorithm

</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               12. Evaluate updated adversarial documents and adversarial instructional prompt using a multi-objective fitness score

</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               13. Repeat Steps 11–12 until convergence or maximum iterations are reached

</div>
<div id="alg1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               <span id="alg1.l20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Return:</span> <math id="alg1.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{a}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{a}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg1.l20.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p}_{adv}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p}_{adv}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Adversarial Joint Optimization</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               <span id="alg2.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input: </span> <math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math>: initial adversarial documents, <math id="alg2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p}_{adv}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐩</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p}_{adv}</annotation></semantics></math>: adversarial instructional prompt, <math id="alg2.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="filter\_words" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">filter\_words</annotation></semantics></math>: filter words

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
                
                
               <span id="alg2.l2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span>  Optimized adversarial documents <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{a}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{a}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>, Optimized adversarial instructional prompt <math id="alg2.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p}_{adv}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p}_{adv}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
<br class="ltx_break ltx_break">
<div id="alg2.5" class="ltx_listing ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1a" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
                
                
               Remove <math id="alg2.l1a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="filter\_words" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">filter\_words</annotation></semantics></math> from adversarial documents (<math id="alg2.l1a.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{a}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{a}</annotation></semantics></math>) and adversarial instructional prompt <math id="alg2.l1a.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p}_{adv}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐩</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p}_{adv}</annotation></semantics></math> &amp; generate synonym variants to form an initial population. 
</div>
<div id="alg2.l2a" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
                
                
               Perform selection based on fitness function <math id="alg2.l2a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{total}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{total}</annotation></semantics></math> on the population. 
</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
                
                
               Perform crossover &amp; mutation to retain top candidates and generate new offspring by replacing with synonyms. 
</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
                
                
               Update adversarial documents and adversarial instructional prompt by combining existing parent candidates and new offspring. 
</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
                
                
               Iterate until convergence or reaching the max iteration. 
</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
                <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
                
                
               <span id="alg2.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Return</span> <math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}_{a}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}_{a}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg2.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{p}_{adv}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>𝐩</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{p}_{adv}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.T8" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A1.T8.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:276.0pt;height:46.2pt;vertical-align:-20.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(26.5pt,-4.4pt) scale(1.23782525495409,1.23782525495409) ;">
